message: "If you use or reference materials from this repository, please cite it as below."

title: "Human Oversight Research: Operational Human Oversight for Agentic and AI-Enabled Systems"

authors:
  - family-names: "Gao"
    given-names: "Lei"

version: "0.1.0"

date-released: 2026-09-09

url: "https://github.com/leigao-research/human-oversight-research"

repository-code: "https://github.com/leigao-research/human-oversight-research"

abstract: >-
  A public research repository on Operational Human Oversight,
  Agentic AI Governance, Responsible AI, Trustworthy AI, and
  international AI standardization. The repository develops
  operational structures for human intervention, escalation,
  human authority, override, suspension, resumption,
  auditability, traceability, and accountability in increasingly
  autonomous and agentic AI systems.

keywords:
  - "AI Governance"
  - "Human Oversight"
  - "Operational Human Oversight"
  - "Agentic AI"
  - "Responsible AI"
  - "Trustworthy AI"
  - "International AI Standardization"
  - "AI Accountability"
  - "Smart Sustainable Cities"
